    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even about the \"monotony\" though. it's more like... the person who lived here, the person who actually had a life and a purpose... they're just gone. i feel like i'm just an empty shell that's still walking around. it feels pointless to even try and \"reconnect\" when there's nothing left to connect to.",
