      "content": "yeah, i'm just sitting here in the dark now. i keep thinking that if that part of me is really dead, then what's the point of all this extra weight? like, why am i even still performing these daily habits when the person they were meant for isn't even here anymore? it just feels like i'm dragging around a corpse.",
